  era: "Section 3 \xB7 Vedic Period \xB7 c. 1500 \u2013 600 BCE"
  title: Varna system
  text: 'The Purusha Sukta of the Rigveda names four varnas: brahmin, kshatriya, vaishya and shudra. At first more flexible, the system hardened over time into a birth-based hierarchy that shaped Indian society for centuries.'
